#: ../../../gpu-safety/bounds-checks.md:1
msgid "Bounds Checks: Pay Once or Opt Out"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu-safety/bounds-checks.md:3
msgid ""
"Every `a[i]` in Rust compiles to a bounds comparison and a conditional trap "
"branch. On a CPU branch predictor you rarely notice; inside a GPU inner "
"loop, two extra checks per multiply-add cut naive `1024^3` SGEMM on RTX 5090 "
"from **7,160 GFLOPS** down to **2,940 GFLOPS**."
msgstr ""

